  Title: SprainedLeg
  Prompt: After your last battle, you realize that the injuries one of your companions
    suffered are far more severe than you realized. They have a seriously sprained
    leg, causing them agonizing pain as they walk. You need to maintain your pace
    in these dangerous wilds, and can't afford to slow down. They will need to suffer.
